  "draft_py": "# Eternal Isolation: Put target creature with power 4 or greater on the bottom of its owner's library.\n# Shapes: Teferi, Timeless Voyager's \"Put target creature on top of its owner's library.\" (MOVE_ZONE to\n# Zone(LIBRARY, OWNER, position)) with BOTTOM; the target filter from parse \"Destroy target creature\n# with power 4 or greater.\" (B5a-destroy-power-ge).\neffect = A(Verb.MOVE_ZONE, {\n    'cards': Selector(\n        count=QConst(value=1),\n        mode=SelectorMode.TARGET,\n        filter=FAnd(children=(\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.POWER_GE, count=QConst(value=4)),\n        )),\n        zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n    ),\n    'destination': Zone(kind=ZoneKind.LIBRARY, controller=ControllerRef.OWNER, position=ZonePosition.BOTTOM),\n})\nabilities = [SpellAbility(kind=SpellKind.SORCERY, effect=effect)]\n",
